_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450049","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4462580-1837955055365097","game_id":"steam-4462580","kind":"update","title":"BLIGHTEN Demo - Major Update, New Prologue, Blocking and More!","summary":"Update notes Melee changesAdded melee blocking (right click) and removed light attack Weapon/Enemy Balance’s Crates health lowerSmg damage increasedStandard enemy attack speed decrease Medkits changed from healing 80hp to 60hpExploder damage increased and can now damage other enemiesMap changes More dynamic and unexpected enemy locations (may appear when backtracking)Added new models and more variety to existing onesNew vault doorFixed texture overlappingNew vault doorDoors to next level have un","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T04:20:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055365097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4462580-1836506165577064","game_id":"steam-4462580","kind":"announcement","title":"BLIGHTEN Demo Live!","summary":"BLIGHTEN Demo is live! Thanks for everyone who supported me and I'm super excited for the community to be able to give the game a try.If you want to try it out, the Demo is live right now:How to join?Head over to the store pageclick the big download demoAnd that’s it. You’re in!(make sure to leave a review after you play!)And yes - if you want to record videos or streams, go for it just make sure you let me see in the discord! - come drop by, heres the link: https://discord.com/invite/QkuwKXYSnG","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T02:28:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165577064","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4462580-1835236783568951","game_id":"steam-4462580","kind":"announcement","title":"BLIGHTEN Playtest Closing!","summary":"BLIGHTEN Playtest is now closing! I've got all the feedback that I need and it's clear there is still a lot of issues with the game.. (the point of playtesting!) and now I can start working on fixing them. So what's next?I'm hoping to release the demo in the coming weeks, expect it to be much better then the playtest!Provide your feedback here: Google Form come drop the Discord by, heres the link: https://discord.gg/jVFrPeZaMH","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T03:19:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783568951","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4462580-1829528821303835","game_id":"steam-4462580","kind":"announcement","title":"BLIGHTEN - Playtest LIVE!","summary":"BLIGHTEN Playtest is live! I'm super excited for the community to be able to start shaping the game through playtesting/feedback.If you want to try it out, the playtest is live right now:How to join?Head over to the store pageclick the big green request access buttonAnd that’s it. You’re in!Note about this early buildBLIGHTEN is still early in development so you can expect missing features, bugs and and little bit of jank. we appreciate your understanding as we inch our way closer to the full ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-08T10:33:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821303835","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"